  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Organisation focusing on Agroforestry, mainly in terms of production, trade and development but also on information and training, on rights and governance issues on agroforest resources. The Southeast Asia Network for Agroforestry Education (SEANAFE) programme aims at educating instructors in teaching of agroforestry (tree products and landscape agroforestry).</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Organisation som fokuserar p&#xE5; agroforestry, fr&#xE4;mst production, handel och utveckling. &#xC4;ven informationsspridning och utbilning om  r&#xE4;ttigheter och sk&#xF6;tsel av agroforestry resurser. Det sydostasiatiska n&#xE4;tverket f&#xF6;r agroforestry-utbildning (SEANAFE)syftar till att utbilda instrukt&#xF6;rer f&#xF6;r att l&#xE4;ra ut agroforestry (tr&#xE4;produkter and landskaps-agroforestry)</narrative>
  </description>
